    "<0b><17c><07>YES <07>NO<08>": "",
    "So how do you like your new work environment?<08>": "",
    "I feel at home already.<08>": "",
    "I think this is the first time we<123>ve actually spoken to\none another.<08>": "",
    "So this time I have a client who doesn<123>t want to\nshow their face?<08><04>Come on<94> you<123>ve seen my face<94> but I haven<123>t seen\nyours. That<123>s not very fair now<94> is it?<08>": "",
    "Maybe after this job is finished.<08>": "",
    "No need to be so bashful<94> but I guess you have your\nreasons...<08>": "",
    "I read in your profile that your parents were killed\nby CAMS.<08>": "",
    "That<123>s all behind me now.<08>": "",
    "Anyway<94> that<123>s enough chit-chat<94> let<123>s just get the\njob done.<08><04>Is that okay with you Vanessa?<08>": "",
    "I can see you are all business.<08>": "",
    "Find the entrance to the facility. You should be able\nto infiltrate the facility from there.<08>": "",
    "Roger that.<08>": "",
    "How do you like your Aegis Suit?<08>": "",
    "Not bad.<08>": "",
    "Your Aegis Suit has a special feature called the\nEnergy Drive.<08>": "",
    "Energy Drive?<08>": "",
    "It<123>s a special attack that enables you to discharge\ndestructive energy contained within the suit.<08><04>If your interested in mastering the Energy Drive<94>\npress START and go to the Menu screen to find out.<08><04>Since the suit is directly connected to your spinal\ncord<94> you can expect the response time to be<08><04>lightning quick.<08>": "",
    "I don<123>t ever remember signing up to be a human\nguinea pig.<08>": "",
    "By the way you can also dodge the enemy attacks\nby using the L and R Buttons.<08>": "",
    "Roger.<08>": "",
    "Use the topography to your advantage.<08>": "",
    "You have to destroy all the enemies in that room\nbefore you can go on.<08>": "",
    "Just great.<08>": "",
    "Good luck.<08>": "",
    "I<123>ve transported an Energy Pod to areas where\nthere aren<123>t any enemies.<08><04>You can replenish whatever you need there.<08>": "",
    "The red circle right?\nThanks.<08>": "",
    "Sonnenblume4 You can<123>t destroy it with your\ncurrent gear. You<123>d better come back for now.<08>": "",
    "Sure. But you underestimate me.<08>": "",
    "What<123>s next?<08>": "",
    "Destroy the energy reactor within the enemy\ncompound.<08>": "",
    "Oh<94> I thought I was supposed to destroy that\ngiraffe-looking hunk of junk.<08>": "",
    "If we destroy their energy source first<94> it will make\nour job a lot easier later on. Especially for you.<08>": "",
    "I<123>d rather take them out one by one-sort of like\nknocking down dominoes<94> you know. <08><04>It<123>s much less stressful that way.<08>": "",
    "Let<123>s just do it.\nAlso<94> watch out for the laser traps.<08>": "",
    "Don<123>t worry. I prefer to stay in one piece<94> too.<08>": "",
    "There<123>s an energy field that surrounds the energy\nreactor.<08><04>Shoot the core when there<123>s an opening in the\nenergy field.<08>": "",
    "Good job.\nMaybe I should hire you privately?<08>": "",
    "Enough jokes already.<08>": "",
    "This is your next target.<08><0d>": "",
    "Mister giraffe.<08>": "",
    "I think you can handle it this time.<08>": "",
    "I can see you<123>re not very good at motivation.<08><04>I<123>m gonna need a big fat bonus for this one<94> you\nknow.<08>": "",
    "I<123>m counting on you.<08>": "",
    "How<123>s it going?<08>": "",
    "It could be better<94> if you didn<123>t keep interrupting me\nall the time with your damn transmissions.<08>": "",
    "Alrighty then we<123>ll do this without a briefing this\ntime.<08>": "",
    "You sure can be a pain sometimes.<08>": "",
    "Come on now<94> does sending an /innocent girl<9d> like\nyourself into battle sound like something a /nice<08><04>woman<9d> would do?<08>": "",
    "You do have a point.<08>": "",
    "The mushroom shaped floater enemy is capable of\nscanning your combat data and sending it to other<08><04>enemy units.<08>": "",
    "So I should get rid of them first.<08>": "",
    "You catch on quick.\nTalk to you later.<08>": "",
    "The front hatch is locked.\nYou have to go through the hatch above you.<08>": "",
