    "I<123>ll save that one for later.\nJust do as I say okay?<08>": "",
    "Well done.<08>": "",
    "I<123>m gonna need a bonus.<08>": "",
    "I<123>ve put in some new Aegis Suits in the shop.\nYou should check it out.<08>": "",
