    "I<123>ve gotten used to you haven<123>t I?<08>": "",
    "Don<123>t get smart with me.\nJust remember who<123>s got your paycheck.<08>": "",
    "I forgot to mention an important thing. This mission\nwill take place outside.<08><04>Your objective is to destroy the core of the\nenemy units<123> insertion point.<08>": "",
